cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use digital-orrery in your work, please cite it as below.
title: digital-orrery
abstract: >-
  A true-scale solar-system and mission simulator in the browser, whose
  ephemerides, n-body kernel and orbital-mechanics core are checked against
  NASA's SPICE toolkit, JPL's DE442 and satellite ephemerides, and flown
  missions.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Isaac Johan
    family-names: Ziebarth
repository-code: https://github.com/Zyzzbarth333/digital-orrery
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
keywords:
  - astrodynamics
  - orbital mechanics
  - n-body
  - SPICE
  - three.js
